[00:07.85]New York City’s never looked so blue
[00:07.85]纽约从未这样忧郁冷清
[00:11.27]My friends are smoking blunts in the bathroom
[00:11.27]我的朋友躲在洗手间里吞云吐雾
[00:15.35]They say that honest love
[00:15.35]旁人说 真挚的爱
[00:16.98]Is a cage that makes you feel free
[00:16.98]是一座让人感到身心自由的牢笼
[00:22.79]And all the girls at this party are so cool
[00:22.79]派对上的女孩 个个光鲜亮丽
[00:26.45]That’s never been a thing that I could do
[00:26.45]而这向来是我可望而不可即的模样
[00:30.52]But I can’t help but imagine
[00:30.52]可我依然情不自禁幻想
[00:32.34]What you say when you speak with me
[00:32.34]幻想你会跟我说些什么
[00:38.66]You’re a spark in the dark
[00:38.66]你如同刺破黑暗的火花
[00:40.72]And my clothes all caught aflame
[00:40.72]绽在我的衣襟里 彻底点燃我身心
[00:42.43]You should feel how I feel
[00:42.43]你真该切实体会一下
[00:44.39]When somebody says your name
